></ref-list><sec sec-type="display-objects"><title>Figures and Tables</title><fig position="float" id="F1"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p><bold>Single-point and multipoint linkage signals by Haseman-Elston regression. </bold>Scanning indicates using the map of SNPs ~3 cM apart; fine mapping indicates using the map of SNPs ~0.3 cM apart. Solid line: single SNP as a marker; dotted line: 3 SNPs in a cluster; dashed line: 5 SNPs in a cluster.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2156-6-S1-S29-1"/></fig><table-wrap position="float" id="T1"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Mean Inter-marker distance and IC for STRPs, SNPs, and composite Markers</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td></td><td align="center" colspan="4">Mean intermarker distance in centimorgans (mean IC)</td></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan="4"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td align="left">Map</td><td align="center">Chr 1</td><td align="center">Chr 3</td><td align="center">Chr 5</td><td align="center">Chr 9</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">STRP</td><td align="center">6.90 (0.88)</td><td align="center">6.80 (0.88)</td><td align="center">6.54 (0.89)</td><td align="center">6.74 (0.89)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">3-cM SNP</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;&#x02003;1-SNP<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center">2.96 (0.81)</td><td align="center">2.98 (0.83)</td><td align="center">2.80 (0.85)</td><td align="center">2.90 (0.82)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;&#x02003;3-SNP<sup>b</sup></td><td align="center">9.83 (0.83)</td><td align="center">9.66 (0.85)</td><td align="center">9.29 (0.88)</td><td align="center">9.59 (0.88)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;&#x02003;5-SNP<sup>c</sup></td><td align="center">16.39 (0.81)</td><td align="center">16.11 (0.83)</td><td align="center">15.54 (0.84)</td><td align="center">16.00 (0.93)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">0.3-cM SNP</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;&#x02003;1-SNP<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center">0.34 (0.98)</td><td align="center">0.25 (0.97)</td><td align="center">0.31 (0.97)</td><td align="center">0.29 (0.98)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;&#x02003;3-SNP<sup>b</sup></td><td align="center">0.98 (0.99)</td><td align="center">0.79 (0.98)</td><td align="center">0.93 (0.98)</td><td align="center">0.92 (0.99)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;&#x02003;5-SNP<sup>c</sup></td><td align="center">1.58 (0.99)</td><td align="center">1.26 (0.99)</td><td align="center">1.64 (0.99)</td><td align="center">1.55 (0.99)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p><sup>a </sup>Evenly spaced SNPs</p><p><sup>b </sup>3 SNPs in a cluster</p><p><sup>c </sup>5 SNPs in a cluster</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>